  characterName: Paula dos Santos
  promptText: An oil company offers the funding that keeps our climate lab alive,
    but only if we agree never to publish findings critical of fossil fuels. Without
    it, the lab closes and my team lose their jobs. Do I accept and censor our results?
  leftAnswer: "Yes, accept the funding to protect your team\u2019s jobs and the lab\u2019s
    work."
  rightAnswer: No, refuse to be censored; scientific integrity must guide the work,
    even if it hurts now.
